ry tourist accidentally captured a cheeky living statue refusing an insultingly tiny tip, never like a staged advertisement, fantasy artwork, animation, game visual, poster, or synthetic video; avoid changing faces, changing clothing or costume details, floating coins, coins changing size, bowl shape changing, extra fingers, fused hands, warped market stalls, duplicated pedestrians, artificial metallic glow, plastic skin, excessive background blur, theatrical acting, exaggerated screaming, dangerous movement, impossible reflections, dramatic colour grading, or any other unrealistic visual artifact.
